{"availability":"available","full":"antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System","name":"QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System","description":"Full-stack, multi-role clinic management system for multispecialty clinics. React + Node/Express + PostgreSQL. Handles appointments, patient queue, medical records, lab-result OCR (Gemini), medications, billing, and AI analytics (Ollama), with JWT/RBAC auth, email OTP, and hardened security. Deployed on Vercel + Railway.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-25T14:06:05Z","updated":"2026-10-04T11:36:51Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://qelcare.vercel.app","topics":["clinic-management","express","full-stack","healthcare","javascipt","jwt-authentication","nodejs","postgresql","railway","rbac","react","rest-api","vercel"],"demo":"https://qelcare.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.774Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.774Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.774Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.774Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A full-stack clinic platform that runs the whole patient journey — from booking and check-in to per-specialty queues, consultations, and cashier billing — with AI-assisted document processing and role-based access for six clinic roles.","QELCare is a production-oriented management system for a multispecialty outpatient clinic. It models the real operational flow of a clinic as an enforced state machine — a patient books an appointment, the Frontdesk confirms it, a nurse takes vitals and routes the patient into the correct specialty queue, a doctor runs the consultation and records findings, and a cashier settles billing — while layering on AI document intelligence, role-based dashboards, and an audit trail over sensitive actions.","It is built from scratch with no ORM and no UI framework: the data layer is hand-written PostgreSQL (schema, functions, triggers, and versioned migrations) and the interface is a hand-built React design system. The result is a codebase that demonstrates end-to-end ownership of authentication, concurrency-safe workflows, third-party AI integration, and security hardening."],"features":["End-to-end appointment lifecycle — PENDING → CONFIRMED → INQUEUE → FORBILLING → COMPLETED, with automatic no-show settlement and hourly sweeps that resolve stale, past-day queue entries so nothing gets stuck.","Per-specialty patient queues across 8 departments — Cardiology, Gastroenterology, General Medicine, Ob-Gyne, Pediatrics, Psychiatry, Rehabilitation Medicine, and ENT — each with its own nurse queue screen and lifecycle…","Real-time lobby display — an unauthenticated waiting-room screen that polls the queue every 10 seconds, rate-limited to survive public exposure.","Nurse vitals capture with database-trigger-computed BMI, linked to consultation records without duplicating data.","Cashier & billing with auto-generated official receipt numbers (QEL-YYYY-NNNNN), subtotals, and a full void/audit trail."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"787da89a4d5eadf6256f793b01d2b2f4d773f4b4ada55851f93f52191b1517db","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.915Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.915Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A full-stack clinic platform that runs the whole patient journey — from booking and check-in to per-specialty queues, consultations, and cashier billing — with AI-assisted document processing and role-based access for six clinic roles.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Layered abuse defense — per-account login lockout and per-email OTP cooldown at the database layer, plus IP-based rate limits on auth, OTP, patient search, and the public display.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Optional (each degrades gracefully if unset): a Brevo API key (email), a Cloudinary account (media), and a Google Gemini API key (OCR and AI analytics reports).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"optional","text":"Optional API keys can be left blank for local development.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> Default admin: admin / Admin@12345 — change this immediately on first login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"787da89a4d5eadf6256f793b01d2b2f4d773f4b4ada55851f93f52191b1517db","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.915Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T11:36:51Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.917Z","hash":"787da89a4d5eadf6256f793b01d2b2f4d773f4b4ada55851f93f52191b1517db","originalBytes":12393,"storedBytes":12393,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","frontend","gemini","backend","database","patient","npm","qelcare-backend","react","run","dev","admin","email","analytics","jwt","app","billing","cashier","env","key","postgresql","queue","reports","brevo","cloudinary","each","env.example","google